msgid "VectorNav External AHRS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:7
#: 9954684da6404e0bb2a008edef5e5d49
msgid "VectorNav Technologies designs and develops high-performance, low-SWaP `IMU/AHRS <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-operation/theory-ahrs>`__, `GNSS/INS <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-operation/theory-gpsins>`__, and `Dual GNSS/INS <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-operation/theory-gnsscompass>`__ solutions that enable safe and reliable autonomy at scale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:9
#: 3b80c793e36a45cebfdfbba4389ee766
msgid "VectorNav products provide a range of benefits to ArduPilot users and can be integrated for:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:11
#: 6f6b8668b2dc4feca35ad957e619c7d7
msgid "Higher accuracy heading, pitch, and roll estimates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:12
#: e4b22138792d4774ab620c32167341d5
msgid "More robust and reliable GNSS positioning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:13
#: 2c434dbeda3c4f6b918b990272c9c09d
msgid "Improved positioning and attitude performance in GNSS-contested environments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:14
#: 94026846f0014b0cba91016b02893560
msgid "Performance under challenging dynamic conditions (e.g. catapult launches, VTOL operations, high-g or high angular rate operations)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:16
#: 2c9c66f2b4e74baebb7779533c0dcbf2
msgid "The VectorNav ArduPilot Driver is streamlined to provide a simple plug-and-play architecture, removing engineering obstacles and allowing the acceleration of the design, development, and launch of platforms to keep pace with the rapid rate of innovation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:18
#: 9ac0b1995d9f49b38551aba607dc77a0
msgid "ArduPilot can use these sensors as an :ref:`external AHRS <common-external-ahrs>`, bypassing/replacing the EKF3 estimator, or as a source of raw sensor data provided to the estimator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:20
#: edf0ac8375984f5c95debeb826e7ad6d
msgid "The driver supports `all VectorNav sensors <https://www.vectornav.com/store/products>`__. In particular the following systems are recommended:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:22
#: 0387099002a54dab837bd86f6cf1c3ee
msgid "`VN-200 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-200>`__ or `VN-210 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-210>`__ `GNSS/INS <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-operation/theory-gpsins>`__: Recommended for fixed-wing systems without hovering, where static heading is not necessary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:23
#: 189cf6a64e7d44819019b26d9abfa4ca
msgid "`VN-300 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-300>`__ or `VN-310 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-310>`__ `Dual GNSS/INS <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-operation/theory-gnsscompass>`__: Recommended for multicopter systems where hovering and low dynamics requires the use of static heading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:25
#: 590ec11c220c40329b2c4f550d917773
msgid "For performance specifications and basic product information, refer to the respective model's `Product Brief <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/product-information/product-briefs>`__. Industrial-series units can be purchased on the `VectorNav website <https://www.vectornav.com/store/products>`__; for tactical-series purchases, please contact sales@vectornav.com. For help integrating VectorNav products with ArduPilot, please contact support@vectornav.com."
msgstr ""

