#: 333d917703e0430f9f6300b279d1427e
msgid "``Baudrate``: Necessary if increasing the :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` above a certain rate. The default baudrate of VectorNav sensors is 115200 bps, but is recommended to increase the baudrate on the sensor to 921600 bps and set :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` to 800Hz, if possible."
